      "notes": "Paper specifies 2 attention layers; release default is 3, overridden by paper. The expanded rebuttal script excludes ETTh1, so global batch 256 is used. Fixed-validation MAE checkpoint selection is a P4 extension.",
      "revision": "a457672c7b0152f74c929858dba2a9c886405519",
      "root": "artifacts/upstream/CRIB",
      "sources": [
        "https://arxiv.org/html/2509.23494#A4",
